('orleans','The Duke of Orleans','Charles, Duke of Orleans, a French nobleman and the king’s nephew.','ORLEANS|Orleans','major'),
('gower','Gower','An English captain and Fluellen’s friend.','GOWER|Gower','major'),
('williams','Michael Williams','A soldier in the English army who argues with the disguised King on the eve of battle.','WILLIAMS|Williams|Michael Williams','major'),
('gloucester','The Duke of Gloucester','King Henry’s brother, who directs the siege works at Harfleur.','GLOUCESTER|Gloucester'),
('bedford','The Duke of Bedford','King Henry’s brother.','BEDFORD|Bedford'),
