('grey','Sir Thomas Grey','A knight of Northumberland.','GREY|Grey'),
('erpingham','Sir Thomas Erpingham','An old English knight, whose cloak the King borrows the night before Agincourt.','ERPINGHAM|Erpingham|Sir Thomas Erpingham'),
('jamy','Captain Jamy','A Scottish captain in the English army.','JAMY|Jamy|Captain James'),
