('pharamond','Pharamond','The legendary Frankish king the French cite as the founder of the Salic law.','Pharamond','person'),
('charles-the-great','Charlemagne','The Frankish emperor who subdued the Saxons and settled the French beyond the Sala.','Charles the Great|Charlemagne','person'),
('charlemain','Charlemain','A later Frankish king in Canterbury’s pedigree, father of Lady Lingare; the text keeps him distinct from Charlemagne.','Charlemain','person'),
('pepin','King Pepin','The Frankish king who deposed Childeric and claimed France through the female line.','King Pepin|Pepin','person'),
