('saint-george','Saint George','The patron saint of England, King Henry’s battle cry.','Saint George','religious-figure'),
('saint-david','Saint David','The patron saint of Wales, whose day the Welsh mark by wearing the leek.','Saint Davy|Saint David|Saint Tavy','religious-figure'),
('saint-denis','Saint Denis','The patron saint of France.','Saint Denis','religious-figure'),
('saint-crispin','Saint Crispin and Saint Crispian','The paired saints whose feast day falls on the day of the battle.','Crispin Crispian|Crispin Crispianus|Crispian|Crispin','religious-figure'),
