('beelzebub','Beelzebub','A devil named beside Lucifer in Fluellen’s oath.','Beelzebub|Belzebub','religious-figure'),
('barbason','Barbason','A demon whose name Nym says cannot be used to conjure him.','Barbason','mythological-figure'),
('cressid','Cressid','The faithless lover of the Troy story, invoked in Pistol’s insult.','Cressid','literary-figure'),
